# The build key (crates/veles-core/build.rs) hashes source bytes, and a
# module loads only into the core whose key it carries: a checkout that
# rewrote every line ending would give one machine a key no other can
# reproduce. LF everywhere, on every platform; the few files Windows
# itself must read as CRLF are named.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.p12 binary
*.so binary
*.dll binary
*.tar.gz binary
